<h1>Grover's algorithm</h1>
<p>
(algorithm)
</p>

<p>
<strong>Definition:</strong>
(no definition here, yet, but
<a href="../terms.html#needHelp">you can help</a>.)
</p>

<p>
<strong>See also</strong>
<a href="lasVegas.html"><em>Las Vegas algorithm</em></a>, <a href="quantumComputation.html"><em>quantum computation</em></a>.
</p>

<p>
<em>Note:
Named for the inventor, Lov K. Grover. See Arthur O. Pittenger, "An Introduction to Quantum Computing Algorithms," page 46.</em>
</p>

<h2>Implementation</h2>
